# Foreign-skip leg of the allocator pairing contract: releases of payloads
# that never entered the runtime registry (e.g. cold-inlined seq buffers on
# the ELF provider profile) are counted here instead of memFreeCount. Release
# evidence must sum both legs to hold across runtime profiles.
@importc("cheng_mm_foreign_free_count")
